  "description": "Polly v8 resilience pipelines for Azure Table Storage — retry, timeout, and circuit-breaker for Azure.Data.Tables TableClient. Includes a built-in TableStorageTransientErrors predicate covering throttling (429), service unavailability (503), and gateway timeouts (504). Completes the Azure storage suite alongside PollyAzureBlob and PollyCosmosDb.",
